  <summary>A cross-platform terminal emulator with tabs and split panes</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      TankTerm is a terminal emulator with tabs, split panes, a command
      palette and profiles, set up through a TOML configuration file.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Wayland native</li>
      <li>X11 native</li>
      <li>DE agnostic</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

